    sEn: "The Health Ministry's interim NFHS-6 fact sheets, released on 29 May 2026, report child stunting down from 35.5% (NFHS-5) to 29.3%, severe wasting from 7.7% to 5.2% and underweight barely moving, from 32.1% to 31.8%. Haemoglobin testing for anaemia was not done after concerns about the capillary-blood method, and the fact sheet carries 101 indicators against 131 in NFHS-5.",
